# RISC-V Inspired Compiler & CPU Simulator

A custom compiler and CPU simulator written in C++ inspired by RISC-V architecture, register-based execution, and low-level systems programming.

This project demonstrates the complete journey from source code to machine execution:

```text id="0jlwm4"
Source Code
    ↓
Lexer
    ↓
Parser
    ↓
AST
    ↓
IR Generation
    ↓
Assembly
    ↓
Machine Code
    ↓
CPU Execution
